{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/y-views-ora-development-ghantoot","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1414,"crm_id":"6709","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Y Views at Bayn","slug":"y-views-ora-development-ghantoot","display_address":"Ghantoot","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"ORA Development","price":21800000,"display_price":" 21.8M","lattitude":24.962476224037,"longitude":55.164428379747,"min_bedrooms":5,"max_bedrooms":7,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Y-Views at BAYN by ORA is a luxurious residential villa development located in the serene coastal area of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/ghantoot/\">Ghantoot</a>, Abu Dhabi. As part of the prestigious BAYN master-planned community, Y-Views is designed for those seeking spacious, high-quality homes in a private, low-density environment.</p><p>The project consists of <strong>5 to 7-bedroom villas</strong> tailored for modern family living, providing ample space, functional layouts, and a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor areas. Residents will enjoy expansive private gardens, terraces, and a tranquil atmosphere, ideal for families or those seeking a peaceful retreat.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_391561fd11.jpg","hash":"Feature_391561fd11","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_8d75b5a06d.jpg","hash":"Banner_8d75b5a06d","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_10_76257f6d18.jpg","hash":"Gallery_10_76257f6d18","name":"Gallery-10.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gallery_7_0e258b5472.jpg","hash":"Gallery_7_0e258