ing location.</li><li>Developed by Trusted ORA Developers: The project is being developed by ORA Developers, known for their commitment to quality and design, ensuring a high standard of living in a well-planned community.</li><li>Exclusive Low-Density Community: Designed to prioritize privacy, the low-density development ensures a calm and peaceful living environment, making it ideal for families seeking a tranquil, luxury lifestyle away from the hustle of city life.</li><li>Waterfront Living in Ghantoot: With its prime waterfront location, Y-Views offers residents a serene, scenic setting, complete with private gardens and terraces, ideal for those seeking a peaceful retreat by the coast.</li><li>Modern and Functional Villas: The villas at Y-Views combine modern architectural designs with functional layouts ideal for family living, offering ample space and open-plan interiors for a comfortable and enjoyable lifestyle.</li><li>High Potential for Capital Appreciation: As part of the BAYN master-planned community, Y-Views offers strong investment potential with long-term capital appreciation due to its prime location, high demand for waterfront properties, and reputable developer.</li><li>Wellness-Focused Amenities: Y-Views offers a range of amenities focused on wellness and family life, including landscaped parks, fitness facilities, walking paths, and community areas, enhancing the overall living experience for residents.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2070,"cta":{"id":2908,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Location_41b1a4d5c0.webp","hash":"Location_41b1a4d5c0","name":"Location.webp"},"style":null,"title":"Strategically Positioned Between Abu Dhabi & Dubai","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p